{"id":"7af3117cdc5ab072","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Polish Presentation","display":"df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation — ZFC Topo10 Polish Presentation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation — ZFC Topo10 Polish Presentation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation — ZFC Topo10 Polish Presentation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"169165d3860d677a\" href=\"?note=169165d3860d677a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c2c52f227661657\" href=\"?note=2c2c52f227661657\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (carrier set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (topology candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (metric candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq X\">\\(D\\subseteq X\\)</span> (dense-set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (presentation-code candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3PolishTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop3PolishTopology}_S\\)</span> (Polish-topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"169165d3860d677a\" href=\"?note=169165d3860d677a\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S\\)</span> (complete-metric predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2c2c52f227661657\" href=\"?note=2c2c52f227661657\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\)</span> (dense-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span> (at-most-countable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}polish\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P,X,\\tau,d,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nP=\\langle X,\\tau,d,D\\rangle\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3PolishTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}polish\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P,X,\\tau,d,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nP=\\langle X,\\tau,d,D\\rangle\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3PolishTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The named metric must itself be complete and induce the named topology; the named countable set must be dense in that same topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology","status":"resolved","id":"169165d3860d677a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space","status":"resolved","id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology","status":"resolved","id":"169165d3860d677a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop3PolishTopology}_S$ (Polish-topology predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-top3-polish-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space","status":"resolved","id":"2c2c52f227661657","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S$ (complete-metric predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-metric-complete-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S$ (dense-set predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S$ (at-most-countable predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop3PolishTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}polish\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10PolishPresentation}_S(P,X,\\tau,d,D)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nP=\\langle X,\\tau,d,D\\rangle\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop3PolishTopology}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCompleteSpace}_S(X,d)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(d(x,y)<\\varepsilon\\to y\\in U)\\}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1927,"backlinks":[{"id":"094d1f8fab5c0d3a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3668","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation.md|58-df-zfc-topo10-polish-presentation]]（